        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Tim Hicks"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "\"Tim Hicks has been blazing his own trail in country music since 2013, mixing gritty vocals, rock ‘n’ roll energy, and honest storytelling into a…"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://www.area506.ca/performerPhotos/_1200x630_crop_center-center_82_none/Boxcar-Wanted_Poster-1080x1080-Tim_Hicks.jpg?mtime=1744261755"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:width": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "1200"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:height": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "630"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:alt": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "In 2024, Hicks hit the road internationally and dropped a trio of new songs — the heartfelt “Last Two Lonely Hearts,” summer-ready “One More,” and nostalgic “I Miss Tom Petty.” With his latest single “Quits” now spinning on country radio, Tim Hicks proves he’s still going full throttle and shows no signs of slowing down.\""
      }
    ],
