    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "THURSDAY, JULY 30   The Martin Boys are a rising country music duo made up of brothers Macauley and Micah Martin. They've been captivating audiences since they were just 6 and 9 years old, starting out by singing in church alongside their mother. From those humble beginnings to lighting up the world's biggest stage at Canada's Got Talent, and recording original music on Nashville's legendary Music Row, The Martin Boys are beginning to carve out their place in the Canadian country music scene.  With their signature blood harmonies, heartfelt storytelling, and undeniable brotherly chemistry, Macauley and Micah continue to connect with fans across The Maritimes and beyond. Backed by their well-polished live band, they bring an electrifying energy to the stage, delivering high-energy performances that leave audiences wanting more. Whether they’re writing songs, performing live, or engaging with their growing audience on social media, The Martin Boys are dedicated to making songs that resonate with all music enjoyers. MORE"
      }
    ],
