    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SATURDAY, AUGUST 1   Since their 2006 debut, Canadian band Marianas Trench have consistently raised the musical bar both in the studio and via their explosive live shows around the globe. Amongst their many accomplishments, the band has two certified triple-platinum records, one platinum record, a certified gold-selling record, triple-platinum digital singles, multiple awards including a JUNO Award for Group of the Year and chart-topping radio hits including “Stutter,” “Fallout,” and “Who Do You Love.”  Marianas Trench’s new album Haven was released in August of 2024. Following the release, the band embarked on a sold-out Canadian tour from coast to coast. MORE"
      }
    ],
