    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SUNDAY, AUGUST 2   Wolf Parade was founded in 2003 in Montreal, Quebec. After a pair of self-titled EPs, the band - Hadji Bakara (electronic manipulations), Dan Boeckner (guitar, vocals), Spencer Krug (keyboards, vocals), Arlen Thompson (drums) - released Apologies to the Queen Mary to widespread acclaim in September 2005. Their song, \"I'll Believe in Anything,\" reached new audiences in 2025 after being played in episode 5 of Heated Rivalry. MORE"
      }
    ],
