    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SUNDAY, AUGUST 2   Nate and the Busy Boys draw inspiration from vintage rock of the 50s and 60s, performed with equal parts technical precision and youthful abandon. Walking the line between pastiche and all-out camp, the Busy Boys are a rare combination of style and substance. MORE"
