    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SUNDAY, AUGUST 2   Dad Patrol is a loud rock outfit based out of Fredericton, New Brunswick pulling inspiration from genres like as math-rock, prog metal, and post punk.  Forming as a trio in 2019 Zachary Pelletier (guitar), Jonathan Marino (drums), and Gregor Dobson (guitar/vocals) began their endeavours as friends creating loud, whacky sounds, never staying stagnant with one prospect for too long. Fast forward to 2022, the group of friends had 2 EP’s, 1 full length album, and a handful of singles under their belt, being called “one of the region’s most prolific bands” in an article by Gridcity Magazine. Come 2023 and the band has permanently added Simon Boudreau on the bass, just in time to begin the creation of their second full length album “Pleaser”, which was released in 2023. Following the release, the band continues to play high energy shows, growing their fan base along the way. MORE"
      }
    ],
