    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SUNDAY, AUGUST 2   Caged Animals is the music project of Vin Cacchione and Magali Charron.  Since 2020 they have called Sackville, NB home and have recently released \"Make Strange Friends\" on You’ve Changed Records. Caged Animals’ music sits at the intersection between folky lyricism and the DIY charm of indie-rock. They have toured internationally, and shared stages with Julie Doiron, DIIV, and Blood Orange, and Vin’s music has appeared in film, television, and acclaimed podcasts: he recently composed the score for Audible’s sci-fi series The Space Within. MORE"
      }
    ],
